  Texts:
  - category: 1
    info: 'A Porto-based studio that builds large, year-long educational role-playing
      games, spun off from Schoolers & Scholars, a research project on the impact
      of RPGs in education.

      

'
  - category: 0
    info: Architecture Director
  - category: 2
    info: '- Developed educational games in Unity for the Portuguese Directorate-General
      for Education (DGE).

      - Promoted from Unity Developer to Architecture
      Director, taking on high-level planning and technical leadership.

      -
      Lead architectural planning for upcoming projects, designing scalable, modular
      code structures.

      - Built in-game content and internal tools as reusable
      custom Unity packages to streamline workflows.

      - Established development
      standards and best practices for consistency and efficiency across teams.'
